/* ---- WAKHAN media client (0.2.73): tracks and films streamed from the WAKHAN server (HLS, several qualities), kept on the same
   second for everyone in the salon through the salon socket. The server clock is the only clock: the phone measures its offset
   with a few pings, then follows t0 (the server moment of second 0) — small gaps are closed by playing 5% faster/slower, big
   ones by a jump. The socket comes back by itself (0.5 s, 1 s, 2 s … 15 s), with a 3-second HTTP poll while it is away. */
(()=>{'use strict';if(window.WKM)return;
